message: "If you use Tally or its design in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Tally: let your agent pay, only for what tallies"
abstract: >-
  An on-chain spending guard for AI agents on Solana. An agent may pay only for an
  item a merchant signed, at the signed price, to the registered merchant, inside
  the owner's rules; a Solana program checks every payment and anything else reverts.
